  "name": "Fusilier's Breakthrough",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your modifications to your weapon improve. You can select a second modification for your Fusilier’s Signature, or improve your selected modification.</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"><strong>Enhanced Siphon</strong>: You no longer suffer a multi attack penalty increase when your weapon has a siphon.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><strong>Enhanced Launcher</strong>: You can Reload in place of a regular Interact action to load your alchemical bombs or grenades, allowing you to benefit from actions that improve your Reload.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><strong>Enhanced Scanner</strong>: Your scanner’s Engram can add additional details when Striking an opponent you or an ally has targeted with a Strike or spell since the start of your last turn. You get a +2 circumstance bonus to your Recall Knowledge check, or a +4 if your Strike is a critical hit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can take this feat again at 14th level, adding a third modification for your Fusilier’s Signature, or improving one of your selected modifications.</p>"
    },
